                </h3>
                <section className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
                    <div className="bg-white p-8 rounded-[1.8rem] border-l-[4px] border-red-800 shadow-sm radar-card relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-[160px]">
